                                            Min Per Ticket
                                        </label>
                                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="parlayMinTicketField" @bind-value="SelectedBetSetting.BetSettingParlay.MinPerTicket" />
                                        <p class="fst-italic p-desc">Minimum is 0.02</p>
